<Page
  title="Privacy | Handoff"
  description="What gethandoff.ca collects (very little), how bookings and messages are handled, and how Handoff treats your business information."
  h1="Privacy"
  dek="Short version: this site collects almost nothing, and anything you share with me stays between us."
