>
  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>There are no cookies, no ads and no tracking pixels on this site. I use Vercel’s built-in analytics to count visits. It doesn’t use cookies and doesn’t identify you. It tells me things like how many people visited a page, not who they were.</p>
  <p>Like any website, the company that hosts it (Vercel) keeps basic technical logs, such as IP addresses, to keep the site running and secure. The fonts load from Google Fonts, which means your browser asks Google for them.</p>

  <h2>Booking the free hour</h2>
  <p>Bookings go through Calendly. When you book, you give Calendly your name, business, phone number and anything else you choose to add, and they send it to me. Calendly has its own privacy policy for how they handle it.</p>

  <h2>Calls, texts and emails</h2>
  <p>If you call, text or email me, I keep what you send so I can reply and do the work you asked for. I don’t add you to a mailing list, and I never sell or share your details.</p>

  <h2>Your business information</h2>
  <p>If we work together, I’ll see parts of how your business runs, and sometimes your customers’ information. Here’s how I handle that:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Anything I set up or build runs on <strong>your</strong> accounts, not mine. You can remove my access at any time.</li>
    <li>I only use your information to do the work you asked for.</li>
    <li>I never reuse your data, your customer lists or anything confidential for anyone else. I do keep general notes on what worked, with nothing that identifies you.</li>
    <li>I won’t use your name or results publicly without your written permission.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>As a BC business, Handoff follows BC’s Personal Information Protection Act.</p>

  <h2>Questions or changes</h2>
  <p>To ask what I have about you, fix it, or have it deleted, email <a href="mailto:tyler@gethandoff.ca">tyler@gethandoff.ca</a> or call or text <a href="tel:+16042038575">604 203 8575</a>. I’m responsible for privacy at Handoff, and I’ll reply within a few business days.</p>
</Page>
